WEBVTT

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.540
The Largo Sea.

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:11.130
Scattered throughout its beautiful waters
are throngs of islands,

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.210
most of which being unexplored,
shrouding the Sea in a veil of mystery.

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:22.380
But admist those isles lies bountiful paradise,

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:27.250
teeming with undiscovered
flora, fauna, and mineral deposits.

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:39.380
There, the shipwrecks of old are reclaimed by nature.

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:45.960
And right now, I'm enjoying
a little vacation here in those tropics.

00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:47.880
If only that were true...

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:51.210
Get ready, whacky Demon Army racers!
Time to find out who's the fastest!

00:00:51.210 --> 00:00:53.790
Ready, go!

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:56.080
Whoa, hold on!

00:00:57.750 --> 00:00:58.960
Stop, Lily!

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:05.500
You little brat!

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.420
Live, live on, with all your might

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:14.880
Follow the light to the future

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:28.750
Betrayed and left behind in this lonely world

00:01:30.080 --> 00:01:34.290
Fearing a tomorrow I've lost sight of

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:37.420
I search for the place I belong

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:43.920
My heart screams out, "I want to be needed"

00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:52.710
I want to puzzle out these entwined identities, but can I trust them?

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:56.080
Live, live on, with all your might

00:01:56.080 --> 00:02:00.080
Follow the light to the future

00:02:00.420 --> 00:02:03.580
Even if you lose everything

00:02:03.580 --> 00:02:07.920
Stay connected to hope

00:02:08.130 --> 00:02:11.630
I don't know why I'm here

00:02:12.040 --> 00:02:15.500
But that's all right with me right now

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:19.380
I have to overcome and press on

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:25.290
So I can smile with you again

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:41.670
<b>A Little Bit of Thought Goes A Long Way for Efficiency!</b>

00:02:37.960 --> 00:02:41.830
Lily is headed to Largo tomorrow on a logistics mission.

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.920
Largo? Why's she going that far out?

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:49.580
The Demon Army and the people of Largo
have a steadfast, unbreakable alliance.

00:02:50.380 --> 00:02:54.000
Largo, huh... Land of the Dragonfolk, right?

00:02:54.420 --> 00:02:59.210
About 3,000 years ago, Demon King Belial
led an attack on the human realm.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:10.460
After his defeat, many denizens of
the Demon World found peace with humanity

00:03:10.460 --> 00:03:13.080
and became a diverse part of their society.

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:19.170
Dragonfolk attempted to do the same,

00:03:21.330 --> 00:03:25.540
but when humans began to aggressively persecute them,

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:28.540
it was clear coexistence was not an option.

00:03:29.540 --> 00:03:32.380
So they went off to live in peace in the Largo Islands.

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:39.040
That's correct, and the dragonfolk still
remember that painful history, even now.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:43.790
This was why they welcomed Queen Echidna's
invasion with open arms.

00:03:44.710 --> 00:03:48.580
It's because of their stalwart support
and fervent assistance

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:53.670
that the Demon Army was able to continue
the fight against humanity for so long.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:57.040
Largo is our army's lifeline.

00:03:57.500 --> 00:03:59.830
Wow, I never knew.

00:04:00.330 --> 00:04:04.130
Dragonfolk, damn... Not surprised
they're still holding that grudge.

00:04:04.460 --> 00:04:09.630
Right. So you want me to head to Largo and
help out with the logistics mission, then?

00:04:09.630 --> 00:04:10.330
Yes.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:13.330
The castle's food and equipment stores are running low,

00:04:13.330 --> 00:04:16.540
so we need to make sure this shipment comes in safe.

00:04:16.960 --> 00:04:19.000
Yeah, that could be a serious issue.

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:20.920
And that's not the only problem.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.750
Here's the mission plan Lily submitted to me...

00:04:24.750 --> 00:04:27.880
Everyone's gonna have a big happy time!

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:28.920
For real?

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:33.330
Believe it or not, this is how ALL of her reports look.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:37.330
Despite being entrusted with enough
manpower to carry out her mission,

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:39.710
it takes longer than usual for her to complete it...

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:44.000
So why're you sending me? Why not send Edvard?

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:48.290
He's dragonfolk himself, and from Largo.
He's gotta know stuff that can help.

00:04:48.290 --> 00:04:49.830
We can't send him.

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:52.880
We need him to protect the palace.

00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:57.080
Hey, I'll get that. And I'll get that one, too!
And the next one after that!

00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:00.420
Plus, he'd end up doing everything himself.

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:02.330
Uh-huh...

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:05.500
Lily won't learn anything if he does all the work.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.380
So you want me to go and keep an eye on her?

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:09.250
That's right.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:13.170
Here I joined the Demon Army
to be stuck on babysitting duty...

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:18.630
If that's my job, I'll do it.
I want to get hired on permanently, after all.

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:20.540
Thanks, Leo.

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:25.170
You can use a warp portal to get to Largo...

00:05:25.580 --> 00:05:28.710
Don't go missing me too much now, mmkay?

00:05:29.960 --> 00:05:33.960
Please make preparations to leave as soon as possible!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:38.420
Are we SURE she's a succubus?

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:43.920
Right, then.

00:05:44.670 --> 00:05:46.670
I'm finally here in Largo...

00:05:51.330 --> 00:05:53.130
Hey, Lily!

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.420
Cut it out!

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:03.630
Go, go!

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.960
STOP!

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:13.210
I win!

00:06:15.080 --> 00:06:16.830
Congrats on getting second place!

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:20.670
Third and fourth did a real good job, too!

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:26.500
Lily, can we stop playing around now?

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:27.790
I'm not playing around!

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:28.580
What?

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:32.380
We were racing to see who could carry
the supplies the fastest!

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:33.540
Scuse me...

00:06:33.710 --> 00:06:34.460
What's up?

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:37.040
We've got a whole lot more to transport.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:38.250
That's fine!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.960
We've only done one trip.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:43.330
That's enough for today! Let's go eat!

00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:54.290
Hey, Leo!

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:57.460
Here, take this, it'll make you feel better!

00:06:57.750 --> 00:06:58.920
Down we go...

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:04.460
Say 'ahh'!

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:07.670
Thank you.

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:09.250
You're welcome!

00:07:09.750 --> 00:07:12.580
There's no way we're finishing at this rate.

00:07:12.960 --> 00:07:17.920
Largo has a warp portal between Largo
and the Demon Queen's palace,

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:20.630
and the isle's storage and logistics facilities
are brimming with supplies.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.580
If the individual strengths of the isle's myriad
races were used effectively,

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:25.710
with the right person assigned for every job,

00:07:25.710 --> 00:07:29.380
it would take a day, two days at the longest,
to get this job done.

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:36.880
If the right person were assigned
to the right  job, that is...

00:07:39.170 --> 00:07:41.790
Hey, Leo, take one! It's yummy!

00:07:41.790 --> 00:07:43.580
I-I'm good.

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:45.540
Then I'll go pass them out to everyone else!

00:07:45.540 --> 00:07:46.500
Hey!

00:07:47.210 --> 00:07:48.500
Here, have some carrots!

00:07:48.500 --> 00:07:49.000
Thanks.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:51.130
So... Who's that?

00:07:51.130 --> 00:07:53.380
Huh? Oh, let me introduce you!

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:56.080
He's really cool, this is my future husband, L--

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:01.080
Black Knight Onyx! And we are NOT betrothed!

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:02.540
Everyone's invited to our wedd--

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:03.960
We're not having a wedding!

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:07.170
Ugh, fine! Force my hand, why don't you!

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:19.460
Excuse me, I need you to focus on these repairs...

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:21.710
Huh? The heck are you talkin' about?

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:26.130
Are you stupid? Any change in procedure
has to be signed off on by the boss.

00:08:29.460 --> 00:08:30.580
The boss...

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:43.830
Dammit. I'm just a temp!
I can't do anything 'round here...

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:51.290
And the isle's inhabitants have lodged
dozens of complaints against us!

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:53.880
I'm sorry, I'm terribly sorry...

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:59.670
We can't apologize more for what we've done,
but I hope this helps a little...

00:09:00.210 --> 00:09:03.710
If this keeps up, the resupply
will be the least of our worries.

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:06.920
We'll end up losing the dragonfolk and the logistics
center altogether!

00:09:07.420 --> 00:09:11.040
And if that happens, then it's only a matter of time
before the Demon Army goes under!

00:09:12.330 --> 00:09:13.500
I'm back!

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:15.500
Why the long face, Leo?

00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:18.170
Are you feeling sick? Wanna eat this?

00:09:18.170 --> 00:09:19.420
Wanna lay down?

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:20.960
My head hurts.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:22.250
Oh, no!

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:24.830
I mean, metaphorically, not literally...

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.250
You need medicine! Does anyone have medicine?!

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.330
I need medicine!

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.250
She's such a sweet kid...

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.960
Does anyone around here have medicine?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:34.250
It's an emergency!

00:09:34.630 --> 00:09:36.000
Have the supplies from Largo arrived?

00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:38.580
Not yet, ma'am...

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:39.380
I see.

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:43.790
Think the job's too big for the kid?

00:09:43.790 --> 00:09:46.210
Lily is one of the Four Generals, just like us.

00:09:46.420 --> 00:09:47.670
Besides...

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:50.380
Our forces, wiped out.

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:53.710
Half of our castle's facilities in ruins...

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:59.250
Yes, but thankfully, there wasn't a single casualty
in the battle against the Hero Leo.

00:09:59.960 --> 00:10:02.630
Which means he was going easy on us.

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:08.330
We threw everything we had at him in that battle,

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:13.000
but it might as well have been nothing to him.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:16.960
Your Demon Queen is an embarrassment to us all.

00:10:16.960 --> 00:10:18.130
Your Highness...

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:20.290
Hey, Echidna!

00:10:21.210 --> 00:10:25.210
I found this growing by the gate! It's a present for you!

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:31.420
Oh, hey! Let's plant a ton of flowers in the garden!

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:33.880
It'd look sooo pretty!

00:10:35.080 --> 00:10:37.880
You're right. Thank you, Lily.

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.790
I'm sure Lily understands what to do.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.580
I seriously hope so...

00:10:53.540 --> 00:10:56.540
Does anyone have medicine?

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:59.920
I'll trade you this carrot for some medicine!

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:02.000
Someone, please, help...

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:09.710
I need some medicine for someone whose head hurts!

00:11:03.710 --> 00:11:06.040
Sadly, she's still too immature.

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:09.710
I can't get through to her with logic like I would Shutina.

00:11:09.710 --> 00:11:12.540
Leo's feeling really sick...

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:15.290
I'm glad she's so worried about me,

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:20.210
but I wish she'd spend half that energy--hell,
a tenth of that energy working instead of...

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:22.170
I've got it!

00:11:25.170 --> 00:11:26.250
Hey, Leo!

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:28.330
I'm sorry it took so long.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:31.080
I got you some medicine for your head...

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.210
Leo?

00:11:36.080 --> 00:11:37.460
Does your head hurt?

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:38.790
I got bit by a snake...

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:39.460
Huh?!

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:41.830
That's a death viper!

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:47.080
You guessed it: I summoned this venomous viper,
and it's gonna help Lily mature.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:50.130
No, Leo, stay with me!

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:52.130
It's the end of the line for me...

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:53.920
As powerful as I am, I'll be dead twelve hours from now...

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:56.170
No! I don't want you to die!

00:11:56.170 --> 00:11:58.380
I know, Shutina can heal you!

00:11:58.380 --> 00:11:59.290
She can't.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:04.500
The warp portal's busted. We can't get back to the castle.

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:05.250
Huh?!

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:11.580
I made sure that nobody in the isles of Largo
had the skill to be able to heal me.

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:14.880
Which means there's only one other way to save my life...

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:17.580
Then I'll go and pick some medicine herbs!

00:12:17.580 --> 00:12:18.790
Just like I wanted!

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:19.790
Please.

00:12:20.250 --> 00:12:22.790
Some should be growing up on the western peaks...

00:12:23.130 --> 00:12:25.080
Ugh, my vision's growing dark...

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:27.000
Hold on, I'll be right back!

00:12:31.170 --> 00:12:33.330
Is west to the right or the left?

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:34.920
That way.

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:35.880
Got it!

00:12:36.080 --> 00:12:37.290
The western peaks!

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:39.210
Cleanse.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.170
That went well.

00:12:56.630 --> 00:13:00.540
And all the trials I've prepped on the road
to the western peaks are ready.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:06.080
To get through them, she'll need to manage
her people right and use the power of teamwork!

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:11.040
Yes, these trials were designed
to teach her how to manage a team!

00:13:11.380 --> 00:13:14.710
It's the pinnacle of on-the-job training!

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:19.000
Herbs on the western peaks!
Herbs on the western peaks!

00:13:19.210 --> 00:13:22.170
Herbs on the western peaks!

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:40.000
She's finally transformed into Fenrir, the Divine Wolf.

00:13:40.710 --> 00:13:46.420
The Divine Wolf is a protective deity
on the continent of Erkia, Lily's home.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:50.880
I have no idea why she's able to transform
into something that important.

00:13:51.380 --> 00:13:55.710
Can anyone in her tribe do that, or is she just special?

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:57.790
There's only one thing I know for sure...

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:04.710
She's already reached the first trial.

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:09.290
I've cast an invincibility spell on this huge boulder
to nullify physical attacks.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:13.380
Huh? Is this rock the kind you can't break?

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:19.920
To break through, she'll need to find
a subordinate who can remove the spell!

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.630
I can't break it...

00:14:33.290 --> 00:14:36.000
Grr! I'm in a hurry, y'know!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:38.040
Yes. That's right.

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:44.960
She'll figure it out soon: if she can't do something
herself, she can do it with a team.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:46.460
And when she realizes that...

00:14:46.460 --> 00:14:47.630
Oh, there it goes!

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:48.540
What?!

00:14:48.540 --> 00:14:50.790
Little more! Little more!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:52.500
Little more! Little more!

00:14:52.500 --> 00:14:55.830
A little more? Don't be stupid!
You're not supposed to force your way through!

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:00.580
Just give up and go to the nearest village!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:06.040
A whole troop of spellcasters is stationed there!
You can run there in less than a minute!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:09.750
Little more!

00:15:14.540 --> 00:15:16.170
STOP!

00:15:16.170 --> 00:15:19.330
Little more!

00:15:25.710 --> 00:15:28.170
She broke it. I can't believe it.

00:15:28.170 --> 00:15:32.040
She did it by herself, without
any help from her underlings...

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:36.210
It's okay! She can't get through the second trial herself!

00:15:38.170 --> 00:15:39.790
This time, it'll work!

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:48.750
Behold, infinitely replicating slimes!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.290
Why are there more?!

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.040
Eww!

00:15:57.210 --> 00:16:02.460
Amongst all those slimes is a single,
tiny slime: the core slime.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:06.500
Take that one out, and the rest go with it.

00:16:06.880 --> 00:16:11.790
The fastest way to get through the trial
is to bring over a perceptive underling...

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:15.040
She could even find someone who can cast ice magic.

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:23.670
I did it!

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:40.710
Halt!

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:57.670
A few more seconds, and you would
have been at the bottom of that cliff.

00:16:57.920 --> 00:17:04.080
This is my third trial, a crevasse
I'd conjured up with gnomish power.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.460
If she wants to get to the western peaks,

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:10.540
she'll need to find a way to get to the other side.

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:13.670
Who're you, mister?

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:19.630
Ah, my apologies. I am Godhart, a simple traveler.

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:22.000
I can't just sit back and watch!

00:17:22.250 --> 00:17:24.580
I've concealed my smell, so she shouldn't know it's me!

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:25.750
Thanks!

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:27.790
See ya!

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:44.830
Even with Lily's impressive leaping ability,
she can't make that jump.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.210
There's only one way...

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.250
Oh, how tragic!

00:17:49.580 --> 00:17:58.290
If only I had a friend who could fly!
They could help me fly across the gap!

00:17:58.290 --> 00:18:00.330
A friend... Could help?

00:18:00.420 --> 00:18:06.040
Yes, when you can't solve a problem yourself,
you can solve it with the help of a friend!

00:18:06.040 --> 00:18:07.630
Isn't that right?

00:18:08.540 --> 00:18:12.630
Wow... Wow, yeah, you're right!

00:18:12.630 --> 00:18:13.710
Okay, okay!

00:18:13.710 --> 00:18:18.920
Thanks, Mister God! I'm gonna go ask everyone for help!

00:18:18.920 --> 00:18:20.380
Take care.

00:18:21.170 --> 00:18:22.630
Phew, good.

00:18:22.790 --> 00:18:27.500
Had to get heavy-handed there,
but now she'll realize the importance of teamwork.

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.380
Now she just needs to put it into practice.

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:34.210
I'll make sure she gets all the practice she needs,
and cover for any mistakes...

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:38.210
I'll see to it that she grows into a fine leader.

00:18:38.210 --> 00:18:40.040
Mister God!

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:48.960
I asked everyone for help, and they said
I can just swim across the bottom then climb up!

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:58.500
Look! Your advice helped me get
to the other side! Thanks!

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:00.130
Oh... Sure.

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:03.670
Another failure.

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.500
Another failure.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:07.380
Another failure!

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:09.210
Another failure!

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:12.500
Come on, man...

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:27.880
Leo!

00:19:28.920 --> 00:19:29.710
Lily?

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:32.250
Did you get the herbs?

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:34.500
Yep! You feeling better?

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:38.040
Uh, yeah. Real better. Thanks.

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:39.250
Yay!

00:19:40.500 --> 00:19:44.540
Sheesh... Ignorance truly is bliss.

00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:47.920
Oh, yeah! I wanna show you something!

00:19:51.130 --> 00:19:52.040
Here.

00:19:53.130 --> 00:19:54.920
Aww, you drew me a picture?

00:19:56.130 --> 00:19:56.750
Wait...

00:19:57.290 --> 00:20:00.920
Do you think we could work like this?

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:12.290
Did you think this up all by yourself?

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:17.630
Nope. Mister God-- uh, Godheart, came up with it.

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:21.920
He said it's way easier to work together
as a team than do something by yourself!

00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:26.210
I thought a lot about it while you were sleeping.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:31.880
I'm real stupid, so I won't figure
stuff out unless someone tells me!

00:20:33.380 --> 00:20:37.920
I assumed you could tell her something
a hundred times and she wouldn't get it.

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:41.170
I thought the only way to get through to her
was by forcing her into the situation.

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.250
But I was wrong.

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:46.080
Hey, so, you think this'll make our work easier?

00:20:46.420 --> 00:20:49.330
But in the end, I was the idiot, not Lily.

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:53.040
Maybe it won't work after all...

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:58.080
All I had to do was tell her "hey, maybe try this".

00:21:02.290 --> 00:21:04.880
Yeah, this'll make it way easier.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:07.500
Good job, Lily! Superb work.

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:17.830
Everyone was super happy to split up
the work and get it done faster!

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:21.710
I realized just how important it is to work as a team!

00:21:24.920 --> 00:21:28.210
Our Beast General is on her way to
becoming quite the reliable leader.

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:33.420
I guess, though I could've done without
the whole mock wedding ceremony...

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:37.040
Why are you laughing? It's not funny.

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:38.670
So, what do you need me for today?

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:42.330
Oh, right. We've no time for small talk.

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:48.580
Leo, I have an important missive for you.

00:21:49.880 --> 00:21:53.960
Let me guess, I'm being made a permanent employee?

00:21:55.080 --> 00:22:00.170
It comes straight from Queen Echidna:
"Black Knight Onyx is to report to me at once."

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:03.420
What? Crap, did she catch on to me?!

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:23.960
Our hearts are always so frail and fragile

00:22:23.960 --> 00:22:30.130
But we still face forward and continue down our long road

00:22:30.210 --> 00:22:35.790
If we don't know something now, we can go learn about it

00:22:36.080 --> 00:22:42.710
We might not know what's at the end of our long, continuing journey

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:48.750
Don't try to do everything yourself, lean on us sometimes

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:52.500
Sharing your weaknesses is strength in itself

00:22:52.500 --> 00:22:56.920
There' still a long way to go, so make sure you won't regret anything

00:22:57.420 --> 00:23:00.330
Dash on! The reason's simple

00:23:00.330 --> 00:23:03.790
Let loose! Make your dreams reality

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:09.920
The future you're heading towards is one you shape yourself

00:23:09.920 --> 00:23:15.580
It's okay to be scared of change, you can go little by little

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:19.790
I want to protect the things I cherish

00:23:19.790 --> 00:23:22.380
(I'm so glad we found each other)

00:23:22.380 --> 00:23:26.710
So I hope you hear how thankful I am for you

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>Next Time:</b>

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>The Drinking</b>

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>Party</b>

00:23:36.460 --> 00:23:41.000
<b>From Hell</b>
